<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Klipton says in talks, cautions holders.</title>
<headline>Klipton says in talks, cautions holders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Klipton Ltd said on Monday it was in talks which if succesfully concluded could impact on its share price.</p>
<p>A brief notice advised shareholders to exercise caution in their share dealings, but did not give any further details.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
